      <p style="color: #FFFFFF; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Buyers who adapted to compliance premiums in 2026 are positioned for 2027 regulatory requirements. Those prioritizing lowest unit cost over compliance readiness face supply chain disruption risks as enforcement intensifies. The manufacturers defining 2026 are those investing in traceability, certification, and sustainable production infrastructure. This mid-year report provides a snapshot of industry conditions; full year analysis will follow Q1 2027 as H2 2026 developments complete.</p>
      
